I Atr</ref> 7; beteran domes <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI</ref> 52,1 | bote <hi rend="italic">zur Sühnung durch blosses Geld zugelassen</hi> II 7,1 | feores <hi rend="italic">Leben geschenkt zu erhalten begnadigt</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:El">El</ref> 13. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 11. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV</ref> 6,2c | legerstowe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> 4 | laga weorðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:WiLond">Wl Lond</ref> 2 | rihtes (weorðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 13,1) wyrðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 1. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III</ref> 2 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 17 (wirðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:MsA">A</ref>; wurðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:B">B</ref>). <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 1,1 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:XAtr">X</ref> 2; folcrihtes <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 8. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 1,1; wurðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:D">D</ref>, <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:auch"><abbr>auch</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 1,1 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:D">D</ref> | griðes <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 1 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:G">G</ref> (wurðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:D">D</ref>; fryðes weorðe III 15); munde Geþyncðo 7. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 3; mæðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 5 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:G">G</ref> (wirðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:D">D</ref>) = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 3,1; weorðe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:MsA">A</ref> | weres <hi rend="italic">Wergeld-Empfangs</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1,9 <ref 